{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>譚輝智近日孖「阿妹」關嘉敏（Carman）與近 300 位粉絲一同包船前往中山暢遊歡聚。輝智隨後亦於中山舉行音樂會，吸引了多達 600 位來自不同地方的粉絲到場支持。他在台上傾力獻唱多首名曲，當演唱至《打開信箱》時更特別走近觀眾席與大家近距離互動，令全場氣氛極速高漲。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9a39baad-d191-4692-b594-98fa08c2e828.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026JjizBv9F491789634900.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9a39baad-d191-4692-b594-98fa08c2e828.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4633915afd9c0a03-1201\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>音樂會上，輝智與 Carman 合唱《一事無成》，瞬間將現場氣氛推向頂峰。二人事後接受 TVB 娛樂新聞台訪問，輝智大爆自己對 Carman 的第一印象：「真係以為係自己，淨係認到 Carman 扮自己嘅男人樣，連自己仔女見到 Carman 都唔相信係同一個人。」 Carman 亦笑言自己已跟輝智的子女變成好友：「我叫佢哋叫自己做『爸爸』，叫輝智做『Daddy』，不過小朋友話唔可以亂叫。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_4633915afd9c0a03-1201\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"74630bba-e4a4-43a5-838f-f3ce0f03afd0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026VHSBpdEoNO1789634900.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"74630bba-e4a4-43a5-838f-f3ce0f03afd0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4633915afd9c0a03-1202\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>另外，現場近百位粉絲更為在本月16日生日的輝智，以及8月24日生日的 Carman 齊齊大合唱生日歌兼切蛋糕慶生，場面非常溫馨歡樂。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:05.636673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":398,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}